{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Watching: Chapter 1 \u2013 The Bunker</strong> is a gripping first-person horror adventure. You play as Jacob, searching for your missing sister. Your path leads through an abandoned bunker full of secrets, puzzles, and deadly dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/2f5ac1268bc2884149d72944bd6dcd8d.avif?t=1761761481\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras_big/2f5ac1268bc2884149d72944bd6dcd8d.webp?t=1761761481 width=1560 height=696 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore rooms, collect clues and items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, activate mechanisms and doors<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/030c6afa0549ca29815f65fb61fc2983.poster.avif?t=1761761481\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/030c6afa0549ca29815f65fb61fc2983.webm?t=1761761481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/030c6afa0549ca29815f65fb61fc2983.mp4?t=1761761481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A virus-infected Human hunts you \u2013 one mistake can be fatal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions affect one of three possible endings<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000100/extras/a6f709d5873538b20626c9e462000d84.poster.avif?t=1761761481\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://sh